OL,3,GNEWSABirds, love notes and silver -
OL,4,Awhat sweeps find in chimneys
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bundle of love letters tied with a
OL,7,Fred ribbon, a child's party balloon and
OL,8,Fa nine-foot scaffold pole are just some
OL,9,Fof the strange items discovered inside
OL,10,FBritish chimneys, according to sweeps.
OL,12,FThrow in four tonnes of nesting
OL,13,Fmaterial and a pile of pornographic
OL,14,Fmagazines and it seems there is never a
OL,15,Fdull day being a chimney sweep.
OL,17,F"You name it, we found it," said Martin
OL,18,FGlynn, president of the National
OL,19,FAssociation of Chimney Sweeps.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
